# ---------------- TK_Player.events (Task 16 Part H) ----------------
# TK4-faithful player controls: the arrows steer (tank controls), Space fires along the
# facing, and the camera sits straight above the player.
#
# SETUP (editor):
#   1. Player actor -> EventSheet component -> Event File = TK_Player.
#   2. One EventsManager on a permanent scene-root actor (never on a spawned template).
#   3. A "Bullet" actor in the scene is the spawn template for `spawn Bullet at me`
#      (inactive/hidden is fine — clones are activated when spawned).
#   4. Import a shot clip into Content/sounds (e.g. shot.wav). Until then
#      `play sound "shot"` warns once and carries on.

when me appears
  set my Health to 100
  set my Invulnerable to false
  # TK4 framing: straight down and centred on the player.
  # A top-down view is centred when CameraDepth = -CameraHeight / tan(CameraPitch),
  # and tan(90) is infinite, so a straight-down camera needs no backward offset.
  set CameraHeight to 600
  set CameraDepth to 0
  set CameraPitch to 90
  camera follows me
  print "TK4 controls: arrows steer, Space fires"

# --- rotation: instant yaw, 4 degrees per tick (240 deg/s at 60 fps) ---
when Left Arrow is held
  turn left degrees 4

when Right Arrow is held
  turn right degrees 4

# --- driving: forward/back along the current facing ---
when Up Arrow is held
  move forward speed 45

when Down Arrow is held
  move backward speed 30

# --- fire: the clone inherits my facing, offset clear of my body ---
when Space is pressed
  spawn Bullet at me offset 30
  play sound "shot"

# --- hurt / invulnerability (TK4 blinks for a second after a hit) ---
when message "hurt" arrives
  unless my Invulnerable is true
  add -1 to Lives
  set my Invulnerable to true
  play sound "hurt.wav"
  hide me
  wait 1 second
  show me
  set my Invulnerable to false
